    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 5 Warrenhouse Road, an impressive five bedroom detached bungalow that has been thoughtfully extended and converted to create a spacious and versatile family home. Boasting high ceilings throughout, generous proportions and a wonderfully private west-facing rear garden, this home is sure to appeal to an array of buyers.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by an inviting entrance porch which leads into a bright and spacious hallway, setting the tone for the rest of the accommodation. To the left, a superb reception room complete with a bay window and is centred around a charming stove burner. To the right, a second reception room offers further flexible living space and features an attractive open fireplace.\n\nThe heart of the home is the spacious kitchen, which flows into an extended lounge/ dining area. This bright and sociable space has been designed with family life in mind, providing an excellent setting for everyday living and entertaining. A decking off this area also provides a wonderful area fro alfresco dining. A sun room overlooks and gives direct access to the rear garden, offering a peaceful retreat throughout the seasons. The adjoining garage and practical utility area are conveniently accessed directly from the dining area. A family bathroom is also found on the ground floor. \n\nThe property offers exceptional bedroom accommodation with five generously sized bedrooms. Three bedrooms are located on the ground floor. The converted attic hosts two further double bedrooms, one complete with its own ensuite shower room. Extensive eaves storage provides excellent additional space.\n\nOutside, the front garden is beautifully maintained with mature planting, creating an attractive first impression, while off-street parking is available. To the rear, the exceptionally private west facing garden enjoys sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening, making it the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing in peaceful surroundings. Fruit trees can be found in this beautiful garden while to the rear of the garden lies an area that was once the family's own vegetable plot.\n\nNo 5 Warrenhouse Road enjoys a location that is second to none, you are ideally within walking to excellent primary and secondary schools. There is a great choice of excellent restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, salons and public transport close by. Stunning coastal walks are right on your doorstep. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport and city centre are conveniently accessible. It is within minutes' walk of Sutton DART station and well served by bus routes. \n\nOffering an abundance of living space, flexible accommodation, character features and a highly desirable garden orientation, 5 Warrenhouse Road presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a sought after location. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this exceptional property has to offer."
      },
